/blog/top-23-musicartist-wordpress-sites-powered-themify\">Top 23 Music/Artist WordPress Sites Powered by Themify!</a> appeared first on <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me\">Themify</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Kurt @ Themify\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5971:\"<p><a href=\"https://themify.me/showcase\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/feat-image.jpg\" alt=\"Top 23 Music/Artist Themes\" /></a></p>\n<p>Over the years, a theme that has surged in popularity for many users is our <a href=\"https://themify.me/themes/music\">Music theme</a>. So for this post, we wanted to give a special shout out to all the artists, musicians, & even agencies that have sent us their creative and unique designs! We\'ve compiled our top 23 artist sites powered by our Music theme.</p>\n<ul class=\"grid3 padded\">\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/train-crowd.jpg\" alt=\"Train the crowd screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.trainthecrowd.com/\">Train the Crowd</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/agtv-music.jpg\" alt=\"agtvmusic screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://agtvmusic.com/\">Ayinde Garry & Triumphant Voices</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/sara-pouth.jpg\" alt=\"Sara Routh screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.sararouth.com/\">Sara Routh</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/the-sums.jpg\" alt=\"the sums screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://thesums.net/\">The Sums</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/cherry-matthews.jpg\" alt=\"Cerys Mathews Screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://cerysmatthews.co.uk/\">Cerys Matthews</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/stone-diamond.jpg\" alt=\"Stone Diamond screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://stone-diamond.com/\">Stone Diamond</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/sean-c-kennedy.jpg\" alt=\"Sean C Kennedy screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.seanckennedy.com/\">Sean C Kennedy</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/undullify.jpg\" alt=\"Undullify screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.undullify.com/\">Undullify</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/city-church.jpg\" alt=\"City Church Charlotte screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://citychurchcharlotte.org/\">City Church Charlotte</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/markus-metz.jpg\" alt=\"Markus Metz\"><strong><a href=\"http://markusmetz.de/\">Markus Metz</a></strong></li>\n\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/chillout-cologne.jpg\" alt=\"Chillout Cologne screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://chillout-cologne.com/\">Chillout Cologne</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/la-low-be-coast.jpg\" alt=\"Lalow screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://lalow.es/\">Lalow</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/taliia.jpg\" alt=\"Taliia screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://taliia.net/home/\">Taliia</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/studio-101.jpg\" alt=\"Studio 101 screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.studio101.ca/\">Studio 101</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/arundo-squintet.jpg\" alt=\"Arundos Quintett screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://arundosquintett.com/\">Arundos Quintett</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/igor-longhi.jpg\" alt=\"Igor Longhi screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.igorlonghi.com/?lang=en\">Igor Longhi</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/tobago-cays-marine-park.jpg\" alt=\"Tobago Cays Marine Park screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.tobagocays.org/\">Tobago Cays Marine Park</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/global-enterprise-network.jpg\" alt=\"Global Enterprise Network screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://globalenterprisenet.com/\">Global Enterprise Network</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/dusk.jpg\" alt=\"Dusk screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.duskac.com/\">Dusk</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/artiststudio-project.jpg\" alt=\"Artist Studio Project Screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://artiststudio-project.com/\">Artist Studio Project</a></strong></li>\n\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/luzogbi.jpg\" alt=\"Luzogbi Screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.luzogbi.com/\">Luzogbi</a></strong></li>\n  <li class=\"image border\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/junko-honjo.jpg\" alt=\"Junko Honjo Screenshot\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.junkohonjo.net/\">Jonko Honjo</a></strong></