orks perfectly with the Music skin allowing user listening to [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me/blog/new-music-skin-themify-shoppe\">New Music Skin for Themify Shoppe!</a> appeared first on <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me\">Themify</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Kurt @ Themify\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1765:\"<p><a href=\"https://themify.me/demo/themes/shoppe-music\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/shoppe-music-blog-image.jpg\" alt=\"Shoppe Music Skin\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://themify.me/themes/shoppe\">Shoppe theme\'s</a> new Music skin was created with the hardworking independent artist in mind. This new layout is released with all the bells and whistles including an online music shop, as well as a new addition to the bonus Builder addon - <a href=\"https://themify.me/addons/audio\">Audio</a>. <span id=\"more-360030\"></span>\n\nThis add-on, works perfectly with the Music skin allowing user listening to your audio tracks. It also bumps up the total number of bonus Builder add-ons from 11 to 12!</p>\n<p> It’s all in the small details that make it possible for an artist to connect with their audience. And now, any artist can sell their tunes directly to their fans using our Music skin’s WooCommerce feature. The music store can showcase both album and song cover art, and a description field and reviews feature only adds to your product’s calibre. Take a tour of our <a href=\"https://themify.me/demo/themes/shoppe-music/\">Music Skin demo</a>! </p>\n<p>And for a short while, take advantage of our Mother’s Day Sale that’