homas Hoeky</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://themify.me\"><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/mother-day-2017.jpg\" alt=\"Mother\'s Day Sale\" /></a></p>\n\n<p>We’re celebrating Mother’s Day with a FREE $100 Amazon Gift Card Giveaway, as well as with an amazing 30% OFF Sale! Make your mama proud with a prize or by sprucing up your website with any of our themes.</p>\n<span id=\"more-358622\"></span>\n\n\n<h4>MOTHER\'S DAY SALE</h4>\n<p>You can use the 30% OFF coupon code: <strong>LOVEMOM</strong> on all themes, plugins, add-ons, and Club Memberships – the promo even includes membership renewals or upgrades! In addition, all Lifetime Master Club Memberships purchases will receive $100 OFF using coupon code: <strong>MOM4LIFE</strong>, meaning you’ll receive LIFETIME access to all of Themify’s products for just $299!</p>\n\n<h4>FREE $100 GIVEAWAY</h4>\n<p>Last but not least, you’ll be able to splurge on a sweet gift for you mum with our amazing giveaway of 3 $100 Amazon Gift Cards. For a chance to win, all you need is to submit an entry through our blogpost in one of three ways: following @Themify on Twitter, tweeting about the giveaway, or sharing this on Facebook. For each additional social media action, you will receive an extra entry up to 3 entries!</p>\n<a class=\"rcptr\" href=\"http://www.rafflecopter.com/rafl/display/ea02e2068/\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-raflid=\"ea02e2068\" data-theme=\"classic\" data-template=\"55c0f16c33d1e0cd316e2fa6\" id=\"rcwidget_b7vxs2cb\">a Rafflecopter giveaway</a>\n<script src=\"https://widget-prime.rafflecopter.com/launch.js\"></script>\n<p>Contestants and sale seekers, you have one week before this double promotion ends on May 19, 2017 @ 11:59pm EST.</p>\n<p><em>Happy Mother’s Day and Good Luck!</em></p><p>The post <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me/blog/mothers-day-100-gift-card-giveaway-sale\">Mother’s Day $100 Gift Card Giveaway + Sale!</a> appeared first on <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me\">Themify</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:68:\"https://themify.me/blog/mothers-day-100-gift-card-giveaway-sale/feed\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"2\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:9;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:45:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\n		\n		\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:36:\"Affiliate Pay Rate Increase – 40%!\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:54:\"https://themify.me/blog/affiliate-pay-rate-increase-40\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"https://themify.me/blog/affiliate-pay-rate-increase-40#comments\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Wed, 26 Apr 2017 04:00:54 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Announcements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://themify.me/?p=351640\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:567:\"<p>We\'re proud to announce that Themify has become one of the top WordPress theme providers, thanks to the on-going success of our affiliate program! We truly appreciate all of the support we\'ve received in promoting and selling Themify products to WordPress users all over the world. Our top Themify Affiliates earn over 4 figures each [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me/blog/affiliate-pay-rate-increase-40\">Affiliate Pay Rate Increase &#8211; 40%!</a> appeared first on <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me\">Themify</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Kurt @ Themify\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1619:\"<p><img src=\"https://themify.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/affiliate-40-2.png\" alt=\"affiliate blog image\"></p>\n<p>We\'re proud to announce that Themify has become one of the top WordPress theme providers, thanks to the on-going success of our <a href=\"https://themify.me/affiliates\">affiliate program</a>! We truly appreciate all of the support we\'ve received in promoting and selling Themify products to WordPress users all over the world. <span id=\"more-351640\"></span>\n\nOur top Themify Affiliates earn over 4 figures each month, and now we have some exciting news to share. We will be rewarding you all with an increase in the affiliate pay rate! Starting May 1, 2017, we\'re increasing the affiliate commission from 30% to 40%! So now, if a user clicks on your affiliate link and purchases a <a href=\"https://themify.me/club\">Master Club Membership</a> for $139, you\'ll receive a payment of $55.60! You can now earn more than ever through the sales generated using your affiliate links with Themify.</p><h3>Free to Join!</h3>\n<p>Our affiliate progam is free to join and incredibly simple to set-up. We provide various options to generate your own affiliate links, and even provide access to Themify promo images. So what are you waiting for? Join now and become one of our top affiliates and start earning over 4 figures each month!</p>\n<a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://themify.me/affiliates\">Join Now</a><p>The post <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me/blog/affiliate-pay-rate-increase-40\">Affiliate Pay Rate Increase &#8211; 40%!</a> appeared first on <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://themify.me\">Themify</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:59:\"https://themify.me/blog/affiliate-pay-rate-increase-40/feed\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"3\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}s:27:\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\";a:1:{s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:3:{s:4:\"href\";s:28:\"https://themify.me/blog/feed\";s:3:\"rel\";s:4:\"self\";s:4:\"type\";s:19:\"application/rss+xml\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:44:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\";a:2:{s:12:\"updatePeriod\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"da